# Coding-agent scratch worktrees. These are embedded git repositories other
# sessions create; `git add -A` sweeps them into a commit, which has happened
# twice, and their presence leaves the tree permanently dirty - which blocks
# the fixture bank from recording a snapshot, since it refuses a guide checkout
# whose provenance nobody can identify.
.claude/
